RustboroCity_Text_DevonDelivery::
	.string "These DEVON GOODS are ready to go.\n"
	.string "I just need a quiet road.$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonStopThief::
	.string "Wait! Those are DEVON's parts!\n"
	.string "Give them back!$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonThief::
	.string "TEAM AQUA has a use for these!\n"
	.string "Consider the delivery rerouted!$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonChase::
	.string "The same gang from the woods!\n"
	.string "He took our DEVON GOODS.\p"
	.string "He ran north, toward ROUTE 116.\n"
	.string "The road leads to RUSTURF TUNNEL.\p"
	.string "Please, will you catch him?$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonRecovered::
	.string "You recovered the DEVON GOODS!\n"
	.string "And rescued a POKéMON, too?\p"
	.string "Take this GREAT BALL. You have\n"
	.string "done more than enough for us.$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonAfterReward::
	.string "Thank you. Losing that shipment\n"
	.string "would have set us back for weeks.$"

RustboroCity_Text_DevonBagFull::
	.string "Your BAG cannot hold this yet.\n"
	.string "I will keep the GREAT BALL here.$"
